<title>TAIWAN: Earthquake rocks Taipei.</title>
<headline>Earthquake rocks Taipei.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake in Taiwan on Tuesday shook buildings in capital Taipei but there were no immediate reports of injuries, damage or the intensity of the quake.</p>
<p>The earthquake struck at 0827 GMT.</p>
</text>
